FINDING [report] run.status must be complete before the gate can pass
FINDING [report] run.verdict must be pass before the gate can pass
FINDING [report] a pass report cannot contain run gaps
FINDING [report] execution.receipt kind must equal "fx-review"
FINDING [report] execution.receipt runtime must equal "fx_worker"
FINDING [report] execution.receipt provider must equal "vercel-ai-gateway"
FINDING [report] execution.receipt auth must equal "AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY"
FINDING [report] execution.receipt credential_source must equal "macos-keychain"
FINDING [report] execution.receipt status must equal "complete"
FINDING [report] execution.receipt timed_out must equal false
FINDING [report] execution.operations[0].schema_failures must be 0 or 1
FINDING [report] execution.operations[0].identical_retry must be false
